## Positioning Guidelines

Lead with **production-ready systems**, not buzzwords.

Target roles: **Data Engineer**, **Gen. AI Engineer**, **AI Platform Engineer**, **ML/Data platform** roles with automation focus.

Niche statement: *I build production AI systems over real enterprise data: ingestion, retrieval, agents, tools, evaluation, observability, and deployment.*

